Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,First Episode\NThe Princess Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Another exercise! Now!\N- Yes, right away, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Admirable!\NAll five on target!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But not in the center, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I will try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit the center,\Nthis time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No! The arrow that hit\Nthe center is not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose is it?\NI can't make out who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go see.\NGo, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He left some directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Frank!\N- Sorry about that arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to see you\Nwithout other people around
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Today you seem more than ever\Nin an excellent mood, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you\Nthat I am not a Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am a Prince!\N- No one can hear us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so there is no need to\Nhide the truth, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,how do I have to tell you\Nthat I am a boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen, take this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pen! Why did you give it\Nto me? What do you want me to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the pen.\NNow I will give you the ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you claim\Nto be a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,be so kind as\Nto put it in writing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For what reason should I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That pen, in reality,\Nis a magic pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.70,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"I declare that Prince Sapphire\Nis a boy".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you wrote\Nthat Sapphire is a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Reread carefully\Nwhat you wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire is a girl"... Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see? You yourself wrote\Nthat you are a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange! And yet I'm sure I\Nwrote that I am a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try again.\N"Sapphire is a boy".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire is a girl"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't write\Nthat I am a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The sentence changed by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, that pen, in reality,\Nis a magic pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot write\Nfalse things with this pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how well one can lie,\Nthe pen writes the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Sapphire,\NI like you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are also very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are you kind,\Nbut you are also very generous
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you go out of your way for your friends:\Nyou have great goodness of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Sapphire, I would like to ask\Nof your generosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...a big favor:\Ncan you give the magic pen..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...to that girl\Nwith the long, brown hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:05:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the one I met\Nat that carnival party...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...and with whom I danced\Nthe whole evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want me to give the pen\Nto that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to know what she thinks of me.\NI can't forget her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forget\Nthat time I danced...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,..with that girl\Nwith long hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Franz! I wish I could tell you that\Nin reality that girl is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Sapphire,\Nsearch in your kingdom..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...the girl\Nwith long brown hair
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and tell her to write me\Na letter with this pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You could go ask him\Nyourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't. My father\Nalmost never lets me go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I snuck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father noticed\Nthat you weren't at the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and ordered us to search for you.\NPlease, Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,return to the castle now,\Nyour father will be furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I had something to do,\Nthat's why I went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sapphire, please,\Ndo what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to the castle, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But where are you?\NHave you hidden yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be found, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it:\Nyou are in the secret room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to wear a dress\Nas a girl today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's natural,\Nsince in reality you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Franz, one day,\Nwill understand the truth...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll have to write him a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"I am the girl\Nwith long brown hair"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, the pen moved\Nby itself! Let's see what it wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"The true identity of the girl\Nwith brown hair is Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,," Oh, no! I can't send\Nhim a letter like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, this really is\Na magic pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes people express\Nwhat they really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is my nursemaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you pulled another\Nof your tricks? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Try writing\Neverything you think of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Prince Sapphire is always so\Nmischievous and impertinent...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...that sometimes I\Nhate him!" There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"I hope Prince Sapphire\Nwill grow up healthy."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, nurse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You must write\Nwhat you think of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! "Prince Sapphire\Nis a wonderful Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,like no other in the whole\Nworld! Long live Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the Prince of Silverland!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Now I would like a hot chocolate,\Nan orange soda, and an ice cream."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very hungry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be considerate\Nof animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how beautiful\Nthis bird is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't deserve\Nto be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right! So as not to forget\Nyour words,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- please write them here\N- Of course, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then... "We must not\Nharm animals."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"I will kill this peacock..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and decorate the hut\Nwith its feathers"? That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did I manage\Nto write this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing the truth from\Npeople is very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, because many people\Nare so sly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is Nylon! I would\Nlike to know what he thinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Prince!\NWhat can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of when you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I think of you? That I\Nam happy to see you doing well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...and to see you grow strong and\Nhealthy, because you must become King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nylon, but now\Nwrite these words up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do as you wish! I will write down\Nfor you everything that is on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, you big peacock! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your feathers\Nfor my hairstyle! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly! Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me, Prince Sapphire!\NExcuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"I am sure that Sapphire\Nis a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will find out the truth"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't write\Nsuch a terrible thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Tonight, at midnight"... Here\Nyou stopped writing, Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I...\N- What do you want to do at midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know! Let me go!\NI don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait for me! Wait!\N- No! No, I'm not waiting for you! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately I didn't write\Nwhat will happen at midnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin, what are you to do\Ntonight, at midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Write the answer up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Prince, I prefer\Nto answer in words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With words, it's easier\Nto lie. Write it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't.\NSee? My hand is injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Write with your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My left hand is injured too, so\Nthere is no other solution left...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...but to talk about it.\N- I won't listen to your lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well, because that\Nmagic pen is truly terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that pen is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, not even Sapphire\Nwill be able to write a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see: I will manage to make\Nhim write that, in reality, he is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! That\Nseems like a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what do we do\Nwith tonight's plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan? We'll carry it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an hour left until midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can manage to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard a noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep!\NBut this is a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to open it somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! There's a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With the firefighters\Nthe flames don't last long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like they\Nwere waiting for the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire, we do not fear\Nyou! We master the fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!\NThrow some water on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't worry!\N- You give us the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And we put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have water with them\Nand they are pretending to be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,With us, the fire doesn't last long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Without water,\Nyou can't be firefighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, remember: if you\Nobstruct us, you will be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Scoundrels! I have realized\Nthat you are fake firefighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't let us work, you\Nwill see the castle in ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, leave it alone!\NThis could split your head open!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Scoundrels! It was you\Nwho set fire to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it on purpose, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.90,0:14:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with water!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I tame the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pump the water!\NCome on! Here it is, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Garigori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me go, Prince!\N- If you tell me who sent you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say! Give me paper\Nand a pen and I will write his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give him the magic pen..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is pen and paper! Now write!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it!\NI took the magic pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well!\NSometimes you are useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have Sapphire in our grasp
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not fail to discover her\Nsecret. Very well! Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, dear Prince,\Nit's over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Garigori's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,First I came to you and saw\Nthat you were fighting with three fake firefighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you fainted,\Nso I brought you here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And so you took care of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tink. I wonder if\Nmy secret room is safe..!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is safe, don't worry.\NNo one will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sleepy..\N- Damn, the pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could that thief have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where is the pen? You kept\NFranz's pen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I had it, but I lost it\Nlast night, during the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A real mess...\NI absolutely must find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could they be taking\Nall these tables and chairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, may I know\Nwhat you are preparing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I don't know the\Ndetails, but I heard that this stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...is for the ceremony\Nof your oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My oath?! But what ceremony\Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I really don't know\Nwhat it is about, Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know that the senior members\Nof the Council have been summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so it must certainly be\Nsomething important,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I don't have the slightest idea\Nof what is brewing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd really like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire! The Grand Duke\Nand the members of the Council...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...are waiting for you\Nin the ceremony hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He only told me\Nto accompany you there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.\NI'm coming right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Council Chamber,\NPrince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this ceremony mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And also, I would like you to explain to me\Nwhy I must take an oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, someone has doubts\Nabout your identity, and so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a very simple ceremony,\NYour Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- And what should I do?\N- It's very simple:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you only have to write\Non this paper...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you swear to be\Nthe Prince of this kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that you will always behave\Nlike a true Prince. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we will give you the pen\Nto write these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the magic pen!\N- What is the matter, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not write that oath!\NI have no intention of doing so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, His Majesty the King\Nhas approved this oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.82,0:18:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,..and has affixed the seal\Nof his consent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you do not want to, we will make you\Ndo it against your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you determined to write\Nthat sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will not write with that pen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise I would write\Nthat Sapphire is a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,\Nconsult Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- He might have some idea.\N- Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it's worth a try!\NI'm rushing to his palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Tink! It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceremony will begin in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- The ceremony begins.\N- Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, the time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me\Nto the Hall of Ceremonies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, please, sit down\Non that chair, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't refuse\Nto go to write this oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, but...\N- What is happening, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem extremely embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,\Ngo and sit down immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you made up your mind? Here is the pen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What can be done? Sapphire must\Nwrite the oath immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you cannot back out.\NYou must sign in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, eagles!\NFaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!\NThere's no time to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eagles,\Nfly towards that window!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, jump! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, eagles,\Nget closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, make up your mind,\NPrince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any reason\Nto refuse to write?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really are not a girl,\Nyou have no reason to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has already taken\Nthat pen in hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?! She's lost!\N- Not yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,if you quickly come up with\Nsome good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must try to save him\Nat all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any ideas,\Nbut if I could manage to drop in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, do it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait!\N- Where is this troublemaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:21:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Franz! I travel around the\Nentire world to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to measure myself\Nagainst Prince Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- given his fame!\N- Damn troublemaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.34,0:22:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers, arrest that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on, Sapphire!\N- All right, Franz! Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who interrupts this\Nfight will be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned boy! Did he\Nhave to arrive right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On guard, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- How are you, Princess?\N- I am very grateful to you, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- To you!\N- Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, quickly! Let's\Ngo! Pretend to chase me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! Hooray!\NNow Sapphire is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sleep peacefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.10,0:23:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was very worried about\Nwhat could happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry. From now on,\NI won't use this pen anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.18,0:23:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I think there\Nis a big difference...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.94,0:23:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...between what is said\Nand what is thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:24:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I wonder if the girl\Nwith the brown hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...will tell me the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.70,0:24:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I really think she will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain\Nthat you will meet again soon
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Is it true? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.86,0:24:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He still doesn't realize\Nthe truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.02,0:24:42.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.64,0:24:46.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.64,0:24:46.00,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:49.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.77,0:24:52.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.77,0:24:52.93,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.94,0:24:56.75,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k41}{\k46}Sen{\k38}'nen {\k52}man{\k41}'nen {\k34}hya{\k25}ku{\k33}man{\k38}-nen{\k33}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.94,0:24:56.75,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.75,0:25:00.05,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k11}{\k47}Rib{\k27}bon {\k25}de {\k33}tsu{\k22}na{\k13}go{\k23}u {\k19}i{\k30}chi{\k19}o{\k7}ku{\k54}-nen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.75,0:25:00.05,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
